OL,3,GNEWSAHeritage train commuter service
OL,4,Atrial 'much needed'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPassengers using a heritage train to
OL,7,Fcommute have told the BBC that the new
OL,8,Fservice is much needed.
OL,10,FThe Bewdley Express is an eight-week
OL,11,Ftrial taking travellers from Bewdley to
OL,12,FKidderminster on Tuesdays, Wednesdays
OL,13,Fand Thursdays, where they can change to
OL,14,Fa Birmingham service.
OL,16,FThe trial, run by the Severn Valley
OL,17,FRailway and West Midlands Railway, is
OL,18,Fintended to test demand for a regular
OL,19,Frail connection between Bewdley and the
OL,20,Fwider West Midlands network.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
